      "id": "sparktraits:heavy_artillery",
      "tab": "TRAIT",
      "sourceModId": "sparktraits",
      "nameKey": "trait.sparktraits.heavy_artillery.name",
      "summaryKey": "trait.sparktraits.heavy_artillery.description",
      "pages": [
        {
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "近距离一枪破盾。警职词条，只会出现在老兵以外的警职身上（义警、法官、樱羽艾玛、控场专家、搜寻者）。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "效果",
              "tone": "danger"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "在 5 格内开枪命中时，这一枪会结算两次：第一次被护盾挡下，第二次照样能打死目标。"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "目标没有护盾时，和普通开枪没有区别。"
            },
            {
              "type": "section",
              "text": "建议",
              "tone": "good"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "text": "对付开着疯魔模式、喝过【铁人药剂】这类带护盾的目标，先贴到 5 格内再开枪。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "ownerRoleIds": [
        "wathe:vigilante"
      ],
      "requiredModIds": [
        "sparktraits"
      ],
      "color": "#D94F30",
      "order": 920
    }
  ]
